  "body": "I haven't upgraded MacOS recently, I've been running Tahoe for some time already. Yesterday I installed version 1.26.7 and it behaved as usual, i.e. it triggered the \"Open anyway\" dialog which allows me to run it without using the xattr command. So, it looks to me like it's something to do with a change in ART between both versions.",
